# This file should be at the same level of HUGO executable file
#
# You can comment this file with the pound/hash sign ONLY AT THE START OF LINE, 
# like this comment you are reading. Empty lines are ignored as well
#
# Syntax (at the start of the line):
# FIELD=VALUE
#
# Fields:
# - GAME_LIB: Mandatory. Name of the game dynamic library (without debug sufix/prefix and without file extension like .so or .dll)
# - CHATS: Optional. Route to the .chats scene/prefabs directory, recommended to be relative to this file
# - MAIN_SCENE: Mandatory. Name of the file containing the first scene to load, without .chat extension
# - FULLSCREEN: Optional. If true engine will run with fullscreen, if anything else i wil be windowed.

GAME_LIB=TestGame
MAIN_SCENE=TestSceneVideo1